<region region-id="536" left="18.00" top="10553.20" width="572.00" height="27.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="10561.70" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratios of the distilled checks against the 1.0 limit; red bars exceed the limit. The generator draws this chart from the values above when it builds the sheet; it does not recalculate inside Mathcad.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="537" left="18.00" top="10588.20" width="572.00" height="84.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10596.70" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Failing checks not recomputed here (tool): R2, R4, R6, R8 calculated anchorage / closure: AASHTO LRFD BDS, 10th ed. (2024) 5.10.2.1/.3, 5.10.8.2.6a/b/d. Bend 4.500/4.500 in; hook extension 9.000/9.000 in; midheight embedment 15.000/8.443 in.  CRSI Table 7-2: straight stirrup/tie hook extensions; automatic 9 in. Trial hook rotation: left +50°, right +50°. Rotated-hook anchorage is PENDING: verify 3D engagement of longitudinal bars and hook congestion. The rotation range is not a code allowance. Bar intersects embedded pile / clearance envelope. Keep the bottom open and shorten, raise or relocate the ends. Recomputed here and failing (tool): Actual face shrinkage / temperature spacing: D/C 2.938, End left · Vertical; End right · Vertical (tie).</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="538" left="18.00" top="10678.70" width="572.00" height="27.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="10687.20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The tool reports 47 PENDING items: 2 Service III and fatigue; 3 FDOT covers; 3 D-regions, end regions and the end grid; 39 actual-cage prerequisites behind the distilled checks (anchorage and closure, splices, load path).</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="539" left="18.00" top="10711.70" width="572.00" height="15.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10720.20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Detailing and geometry flags: 42 pass, as reported by the tool.</p></text>
</region>
</regions>
